id=MTK_D8100_Vulkan1.4.Panvk
name=Dimensity 8100 PanVK WSI7 (Vulkan only)
version=1.1.0-beta1
versionCode=11
author=wxcvm; upstream zenithblue-oss
description=PanVK WSI7 1.1.0-beta1 (Mesa 26.3 + 019-038 patches) for PGKM10/Android 17. Adds the AFBC YU10 (DRM_FORMAT_YUV420_10BIT) Vulkan import path so the 10-bit video/lock-screen layers that aborted SurfaceFlinger can now be created, bound and sampled; skiavkthreaded remains an experimental opt-in (SF RenderEngine stays skiagl by default). Includes the 1.0.0 fixes: GPU-uncached imports (shareability fault) and one-shot Android acquire replay (WeChat).
